{"title":"Resources","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Resources","comments":false,"toc":false},"headingText":"GPU Programming","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<p class=\"project-page-intro\">\nCurated learning resources for GPU programming, ML systems, inference\noptimization, and performance engineering. The GPU programming section is\norganized from foundations to frontier kernel work.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"project-category-grid\">\n  <a class=\"project-category-card\" href=\"#gpu-programming\">\n    <span class=\"project-card-kicker\">CUDA / Triton / CuTe</span>\n    <span class=\"project-card-title\">GPU Programming</span>\n    <span class=\"project-card-description\">\n      A structured path through GPU architecture, CUDA fundamentals, Triton,\n      CUTLASS, CuTe DSL, GEMM, attention kernels, PTX, profiling, and modern\n      ML systems performance work.\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"project-card-tags\">\n      <span>CUDA</span>\n      <span>Triton</span>\n      <span>Performance</span>\n    </span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n\n### Start Here\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://github.com/wafer-ai/gpu-perf-engineering-resources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">GPU Performance Engineering Resources</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">A broad curriculum for learning GPU performance engineering from fundamentals toward frontier AI-lab kernel work</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://mlc.ai/modern-gpu-programming-for-mlsys/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Modern GPU Programming for ML Systems</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">MLC course-style notes for writing modern GPU programs in the context of ML systems</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://damek.github.io/random/basic-facts-about-gpus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Basic Facts About GPUs</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">A concise mental model for GPU architecture, execution, memory hierarchy, and practical performance constraints</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://modal.com/gpu-glossary/readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Modal GPU Glossary</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Quick reference for GPU terms, architecture vocabulary, serving concepts, and accelerator terminology</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### CUDA Foundations\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxNPSjHT5qvtYRVdNN1yDcdSl39uHV_sU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Nick CUDA Crash Course</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Fast practical introduction to CUDA programming and kernel structure</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAwxTw4SYaPnFKojVQrmyOGFCqHTxfdv2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Udacity Intro to Parallel Programming</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Classic foundations for parallel algorithms, CUDA kernels, scans, reductions, sorting, and GPU thinking</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5B692fm6--vWLhYPqLcEu6RF3hXjEyJr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NVIDIA Modern CUDA C++ Programming Class</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Official NVIDIA CUDA training material covering modern CUDA C++ programming patterns</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL6RdenZrxrw-zNX7uuGppWETdxt_JxdMj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">OLCF CUDA Training Series</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">HPC-oriented CUDA lessons from Oak Ridge, useful for serious systems and performance practice</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://cvw.cac.cornell.edu/cuda-intro/cuda-concepts/index\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Cornell Virtual Workshop: CUDA Concepts</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Readable CUDA concept notes for kernels, grids, blocks, memory, and execution hierarchy</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Triton, CuTe, CUTLASS, and DSLs\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_NMDNzkCbLR69QafQUa6yTx-T-VPIoaZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Triton GPU Kernels 101</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Beginner-friendly Triton path with examples for writing custom ML kernels in Python</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL16vydMdqFg8kOQk9rPAyi_MC6KL3C7x0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Triton Kernels Playlist</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Common deep learning operators implemented as Triton kernels</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G6q719ck7ww\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">GPU Mode Lecture: CUTLASS</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUTLASS concepts, abstractions, and how production GEMM kernels are structured</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jGouxuAHIfQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Learning CUTLASS the Hard Way</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Deep dive into understanding CUTLASS by working through its abstractions and performance model</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-dfte_N3yk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Getting Started with CuTe DSL</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Practical entry point for NVIDIA CuTe DSL and layout-driven kernel programming</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://shahfahad50951.github.io/writings/cute-layouts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CuTe Layouts</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Notes on CuTe layout algebra, a key idea behind modern CUTLASS and CuTe DSL kernels</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### GEMM and Tensor Cores\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://siboehm.com/articles/22/CUDA-MMM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">How to Optimize a CUDA Matmul Kernel</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Canonical step-by-step CUDA SGEMM optimization path toward cuBLAS-like performance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.aleksagordic.com/blog/matmul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Inside NVIDIA GPUs: High-Performance Matmul Kernels</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Architecture, PTX/SASS, warp tiling, asynchronous pipelines, and tensor-core matmul intuition</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.cloudrift.ai/blog/gpu-matmul-optimization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Modern GPU Matmul Optimization</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Register tiling, vectorized loads, shared-memory staging, cp.async, TMA, warp specialization, split-K, and tensor cores</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://salykova.github.io/gemm-gpu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Advanced Matrix Multiplication Optimization</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUDA SGEMM optimization with inline PTX, asynchronous memory copies, double buffering, and bank-conflict avoidance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://mlc.ai/modern-gpu-programming-for-mlsys/chapter_tensor_cores/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Tensor Cores for ML Systems</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Modern tensor-core programming concepts for ML workloads</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.modular.com/blog/matrix-multiplication-on-blackwell-part-4---breaking-sota\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Matrix Multiplication on Blackwell: Breaking SOTA</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Blackwell matmul optimization case study with cluster launch control and state-of-the-art performance targets</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Attention and LLM Inference Kernels\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.lowlevelml.com/blog/flash-attention-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">FlashAttention from the Bottom Up</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Low-level explanation of FlashAttention and why memory movement dominates attention performance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zy8ChVd_oTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">FlashAttention in Triton from First Principles</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Derives and implements FlashAttention with Triton, including the reasoning behind the algorithm</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwUcZwPOCpA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CUTLASS and FlashAttention 3</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">GPU Mode lecture on CUTLASS and FlashAttention 3 implementation ideas</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/ZIEq-WTquy4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">How FlashAttention 4 Works</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Walkthrough of newer FlashAttention ideas and reverse-engineering attention performance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://pytorch.org/blog/flexattention/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">PyTorch FlexAttention</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">PyTorch-native attention flexibility and performance for custom attention masks and patterns</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://kyrieblunders.bearblog.dev/making-dr-grpo-go-brrr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Making Dr GRPO Go Brrr</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Fused decode-attention kernel work in an RL training loop, with practical microbenchmarking context</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### PTX, SASS, and Hardware Internals\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://philipfabianek.com/posts/cuda-ptx-introduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">A Gentle Introduction to CUDA PTX</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUDA compilation pipeline, PTX, SASS, and a hand-written PTX kernel playground</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://gh.evko.io/crucible-notes/ptxas/intrinsics/tensor.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Tensor Core Intrinsics: PTXAS Reverse Engineering Notes</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Reference notes for tensor-core intrinsics, PTXAS behavior, register allocation, and instruction scheduling</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://dev.to/sfahad/programming-hopper-gpus-the-memory-consistency-model-24m7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Programming Hopper GPUs: Memory Consistency Model</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Hopper-era memory consistency and synchronization details for advanced kernel work</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://verda.com/blog/nvfp4-nvidia-blackwell-intro#conclusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NVFP4 Explained</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Blackwell low-precision floating point, microscaling, and hardware-algorithm co-design</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://research.colfax-intl.com/cutlass-tutorial-nvfp4-blockscaled-gemm-on-nvidia-rtx-pro-blackwell-gpus-sm12x/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NVFP4 Blockscaled GEMM with CUTLASS</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUTLASS tutorial for Blackwell-class NVFP4 blockscaled GEMM kernels</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Profiling and Performance Analysis\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=27vRMM5JcSg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Introduction to Performance Analysis for NVIDIA GPUs</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Profiler-driven workflow for identifying common GPU performance bottlenecks</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxVedhmuwLq0RiX3X4iF7D4WOVvYfNKDe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NHR PerfLab Seminar Series</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Performance engineering talks across GPU programming, profiling, and HPC optimization</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/cutlass/latest/media/docs/cpp/gemm_performance_measurement_methodology_guidelines.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CUTLASS GEMM Performance Measurement Guidelines</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Benchmarking methodology for GEMM kernels, measurement hygiene, and comparing against library baselines</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/kernel-fusion-in-nvidia-cuda-optimizing-memory-traffic-and-launch-overhead/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Kernel Fusion in CUDA</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">How fusion reduces memory traffic and launch overhead, with practical CUDA optimization patterns</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Deep Dives and Reference Collections\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.dcbaslani.xyz/blog/gpu_masterclass/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">The Feynman GPU Lectures</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">A bottom-up GPU masterclass from transistors and CUDA cores to Tensor Cores, Hopper, and Blackwell</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/author/bob-crovella/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Bob Crovella: NVIDIA Technical Blog</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Author archive with practical CUDA explanations, performance notes, and NVIDIA platform guidance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.cudahandbook.com/book/ch1/our-approach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">The CUDA Handbook</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Book-style CUDA resource for building a durable understanding of GPU programming</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://forejune.co/cuda/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CUDA Notes</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Compact notes and examples for CUDA programming concepts</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<p class=\"project-page-intro\">\nCurated learning resources for GPU programming, ML systems, inference\noptimization, and performance engineering. The GPU programming section is\norganized from foundations to frontier kernel work.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"project-category-grid\">\n  <a class=\"project-category-card\" href=\"#gpu-programming\">\n    <span class=\"project-card-kicker\">CUDA / Triton / CuTe</span>\n    <span class=\"project-card-title\">GPU Programming</span>\n    <span class=\"project-card-description\">\n      A structured path through GPU architecture, CUDA fundamentals, Triton,\n      CUTLASS, CuTe DSL, GEMM, attention kernels, PTX, profiling, and modern\n      ML systems performance work.\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"project-card-tags\">\n      <span>CUDA</span>\n      <span>Triton</span>\n      <span>Performance</span>\n    </span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n## GPU Programming\n\n### Start Here\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://github.com/wafer-ai/gpu-perf-engineering-resources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">GPU Performance Engineering Resources</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">A broad curriculum for learning GPU performance engineering from fundamentals toward frontier AI-lab kernel work</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://mlc.ai/modern-gpu-programming-for-mlsys/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Modern GPU Programming for ML Systems</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">MLC course-style notes for writing modern GPU programs in the context of ML systems</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://damek.github.io/random/basic-facts-about-gpus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Basic Facts About GPUs</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">A concise mental model for GPU architecture, execution, memory hierarchy, and practical performance constraints</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://modal.com/gpu-glossary/readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Modal GPU Glossary</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Quick reference for GPU terms, architecture vocabulary, serving concepts, and accelerator terminology</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### CUDA Foundations\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxNPSjHT5qvtYRVdNN1yDcdSl39uHV_sU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Nick CUDA Crash Course</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Fast practical introduction to CUDA programming and kernel structure</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAwxTw4SYaPnFKojVQrmyOGFCqHTxfdv2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Udacity Intro to Parallel Programming</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Classic foundations for parallel algorithms, CUDA kernels, scans, reductions, sorting, and GPU thinking</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5B692fm6--vWLhYPqLcEu6RF3hXjEyJr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NVIDIA Modern CUDA C++ Programming Class</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Official NVIDIA CUDA training material covering modern CUDA C++ programming patterns</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL6RdenZrxrw-zNX7uuGppWETdxt_JxdMj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">OLCF CUDA Training Series</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">HPC-oriented CUDA lessons from Oak Ridge, useful for serious systems and performance practice</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://cvw.cac.cornell.edu/cuda-intro/cuda-concepts/index\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Cornell Virtual Workshop: CUDA Concepts</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Readable CUDA concept notes for kernels, grids, blocks, memory, and execution hierarchy</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Triton, CuTe, CUTLASS, and DSLs\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL_NMDNzkCbLR69QafQUa6yTx-T-VPIoaZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Triton GPU Kernels 101</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Beginner-friendly Triton path with examples for writing custom ML kernels in Python</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL16vydMdqFg8kOQk9rPAyi_MC6KL3C7x0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Triton Kernels Playlist</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Common deep learning operators implemented as Triton kernels</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G6q719ck7ww\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">GPU Mode Lecture: CUTLASS</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUTLASS concepts, abstractions, and how production GEMM kernels are structured</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jGouxuAHIfQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Learning CUTLASS the Hard Way</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Deep dive into understanding CUTLASS by working through its abstractions and performance model</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-dfte_N3yk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Getting Started with CuTe DSL</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Practical entry point for NVIDIA CuTe DSL and layout-driven kernel programming</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://shahfahad50951.github.io/writings/cute-layouts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CuTe Layouts</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Notes on CuTe layout algebra, a key idea behind modern CUTLASS and CuTe DSL kernels</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### GEMM and Tensor Cores\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://siboehm.com/articles/22/CUDA-MMM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">How to Optimize a CUDA Matmul Kernel</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Canonical step-by-step CUDA SGEMM optimization path toward cuBLAS-like performance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.aleksagordic.com/blog/matmul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Inside NVIDIA GPUs: High-Performance Matmul Kernels</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Architecture, PTX/SASS, warp tiling, asynchronous pipelines, and tensor-core matmul intuition</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.cloudrift.ai/blog/gpu-matmul-optimization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Modern GPU Matmul Optimization</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Register tiling, vectorized loads, shared-memory staging, cp.async, TMA, warp specialization, split-K, and tensor cores</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://salykova.github.io/gemm-gpu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Advanced Matrix Multiplication Optimization</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUDA SGEMM optimization with inline PTX, asynchronous memory copies, double buffering, and bank-conflict avoidance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://mlc.ai/modern-gpu-programming-for-mlsys/chapter_tensor_cores/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Tensor Cores for ML Systems</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Modern tensor-core programming concepts for ML workloads</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.modular.com/blog/matrix-multiplication-on-blackwell-part-4---breaking-sota\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Matrix Multiplication on Blackwell: Breaking SOTA</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Blackwell matmul optimization case study with cluster launch control and state-of-the-art performance targets</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Attention and LLM Inference Kernels\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.lowlevelml.com/blog/flash-attention-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">FlashAttention from the Bottom Up</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Low-level explanation of FlashAttention and why memory movement dominates attention performance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zy8ChVd_oTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">FlashAttention in Triton from First Principles</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Derives and implements FlashAttention with Triton, including the reasoning behind the algorithm</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwUcZwPOCpA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CUTLASS and FlashAttention 3</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">GPU Mode lecture on CUTLASS and FlashAttention 3 implementation ideas</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/ZIEq-WTquy4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">How FlashAttention 4 Works</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Walkthrough of newer FlashAttention ideas and reverse-engineering attention performance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://pytorch.org/blog/flexattention/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">PyTorch FlexAttention</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">PyTorch-native attention flexibility and performance for custom attention masks and patterns</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://kyrieblunders.bearblog.dev/making-dr-grpo-go-brrr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Making Dr GRPO Go Brrr</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Fused decode-attention kernel work in an RL training loop, with practical microbenchmarking context</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### PTX, SASS, and Hardware Internals\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://philipfabianek.com/posts/cuda-ptx-introduction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">A Gentle Introduction to CUDA PTX</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUDA compilation pipeline, PTX, SASS, and a hand-written PTX kernel playground</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://gh.evko.io/crucible-notes/ptxas/intrinsics/tensor.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Tensor Core Intrinsics: PTXAS Reverse Engineering Notes</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Reference notes for tensor-core intrinsics, PTXAS behavior, register allocation, and instruction scheduling</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://dev.to/sfahad/programming-hopper-gpus-the-memory-consistency-model-24m7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Programming Hopper GPUs: Memory Consistency Model</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Hopper-era memory consistency and synchronization details for advanced kernel work</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://verda.com/blog/nvfp4-nvidia-blackwell-intro#conclusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NVFP4 Explained</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Blackwell low-precision floating point, microscaling, and hardware-algorithm co-design</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://research.colfax-intl.com/cutlass-tutorial-nvfp4-blockscaled-gemm-on-nvidia-rtx-pro-blackwell-gpus-sm12x/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NVFP4 Blockscaled GEMM with CUTLASS</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">CUTLASS tutorial for Blackwell-class NVFP4 blockscaled GEMM kernels</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Profiling and Performance Analysis\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=27vRMM5JcSg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Introduction to Performance Analysis for NVIDIA GPUs</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Profiler-driven workflow for identifying common GPU performance bottlenecks</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxVedhmuwLq0RiX3X4iF7D4WOVvYfNKDe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">NHR PerfLab Seminar Series</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Performance engineering talks across GPU programming, profiling, and HPC optimization</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/cutlass/latest/media/docs/cpp/gemm_performance_measurement_methodology_guidelines.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CUTLASS GEMM Performance Measurement Guidelines</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Benchmarking methodology for GEMM kernels, measurement hygiene, and comparing against library baselines</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/kernel-fusion-in-nvidia-cuda-optimizing-memory-traffic-and-launch-overhead/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Kernel Fusion in CUDA</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">How fusion reduces memory traffic and launch overhead, with practical CUDA optimization patterns</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n### Deep Dives and Reference Collections\n\n<div class=\"project-stack\">\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.dcbaslani.xyz/blog/gpu_masterclass/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">The Feynman GPU Lectures</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">A bottom-up GPU masterclass from transistors and CUDA cores to Tensor Cores, Hopper, and Blackwell</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/author/bob-crovella/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">Bob Crovella: NVIDIA Technical Blog</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Author archive with practical CUDA explanations, performance notes, and NVIDIA platform guidance</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://www.cudahandbook.com/book/ch1/our-approach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">The CUDA Handbook</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Book-style CUDA resource for building a durable understanding of GPU programming</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"project-row-card\" href=\"https://forejune.co/cuda/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <span class=\"project-row-title\">CUDA Notes</span>\n    <span class=\"project-row-meta\">Compact notes and examples for CUDA programming concepts</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n"},"formats":